 sketches, module contents

Docstrings only (policy.md: each public declaration's docstring states its formula; every
nontrivial proof carries a sketch). A backticked formula matching the statement is added to the
first sentence of each of the 94 NO-FORMULA public declarations of the r1 docaudit; a
**Proof sketch.** paragraph is added to each of the 15 proofs of 15 or more lines without one
(6 public, 9 private); `## Main definitions` is added to the module docstrings of Forgery.lean
and Transfer.lean. Reference tags and existing sketches are kept. No statement, proof, name,
attribute or import changes; the target ccaScheme_cca2 is unchanged.

